	(descr "Omron G6K-2P-Y-T1 PCB signal relay, DPDT, through-hole, high-temperature variant. Body 10.0 x 6.5 x 5.4 mm. Non-uniform DIP pitch per the Y terminal arrangement: 3.2 mm coil-to-contact, 2.2 mm between contact terminals, 5.08 mm row spacing. 8 x 0.85 mm NPTH recommended per Omron. Pin 1 = coil(+), Pin 8 = coil(-), Pins 2/3/4 = pole 1 NC/COM/NO, Pins 5/6/7 = pole 2 NC/COM/NO.")
